      "id": "claim_40b5ac6d4234424990ff3516660954ec",
      "statement": "The deployed service separates typed FastAPI run-lifecycle request handling from worker execution: submission persists a queued run and enqueues its ID, while the worker executes it through `AgentRuntime` and persists terminal results and artifact references.",
